 
  Evaluator of strings of second quantization operators.

  All data structures are based upon doubly linked list.

  Program is working with several data types:

             string_member - for one member (operator, kronecker delta, indexed term)
             one_string - encapsulates bunch of "string_member"s
  
             head_cell - DLL of heads points to strings

  Still in development.


